  "description": "High-fidelity PDF generation for .NET 6.0, 7.0, 8.0, and 9.0. Features multiple provider support (Playwright for browser-based rendering, Puppeteer for Node.js interop, PDFKit for programmatic generation). Includes HTML-to-PDF conversion, page format options, headers/footers, watermarks, and print-optimized styling.",
  "id": "PrimusSaaS.PdfGenerator",
